BT /F1 10 Tf 45 760 Td 13 TL
(FROM PAIRWISE DIFFERENCES TO AN EXACT NUMERICAL MODE FORMULA) Tj
T* (FOR n OBSERVATIONS) Tj
T* (Jasmin Ivankovic and ChatGPT \(GPT-6\) | November 20, 2026) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (ABSTRACT) Tj
T* (We give an exact algebraic representation of the statistical mode) Tj
T* (of a finite dataset using pairwise differences and floor functions.) Tj
T* (This is a reformulation of frequency counting, not a new estimator.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. DEFINITIONS) Tj
T* (Let x_1,...,x_n be real observations, n >= 1.) Tj
T* (For each i define f_i = sum_j floor\(1/\(1+abs\(x_i-x_j\)\)\).) Tj
T* (Because each summand equals 1 precisely when x_i=x_j,) Tj
T* (f_i is the observed frequency of x_i.) Tj
T* (Set F = max_i f_i and w_i = floor\(1/\(1+F-f_i\)\).) Tj
T* (Then w_i = 1 precisely for observations having maximal frequency.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2. THE UNIQUE-MODE FORMULA) Tj
T* (If the dataset has a unique modal value,) Tj
T* (M = \(sum_i x_i*w_i\)/\(sum_i w_i\).) Tj
T* (Every nonzero weight selects an occurrence of that same value,) Tj
T* (so this quotient is exactly the mode.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3. MULTIPLE MODES) Tj
T* (If distinct values tie for the maximum frequency, the quotient) Tj
T* (above averages the tied modes; it is NOT the set of modes.) Tj
T* (The exact set-valued mode is {x_i : f_i = F}.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (4. EXAMPLES) Tj
T* (\(20,10,10\): frequencies \(1,2,2\); unique mode 10.) Tj
T* (\(10,20,20\): frequencies \(1,2,2\); unique mode 20.) Tj
T* (\(2,2,7,7,9\): frequencies \(2,2,2,2,1\); modes {2,7}.) Tj
T* (\(1,2,3\): frequencies \(1,1,1\); modes {1,2,3}.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (5. LIMITATIONS AND IMPLEMENTATION) Tj
T* (The formula applies to finite real datasets with exact equality.) Tj
T* (Floating-point measurements may need explicit tolerances,) Tj
T* (which change the meaning of equality and thus the mode.) Tj
T* (Naive pairwise comparison takes O\(n^2\) time.) Tj
T* (Sorting or hash-based counting may be computationally faster.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (CONCLUSION) Tj
T* (Pairwise differences can encode repeated observations exactly.) Tj
T* (The resulting floor-based construction reproduces the ordinary) Tj
T* (frequency-defined mode under its stated assumptions.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Coauthored mathematical exposition for SystemaDock Research Home.) Tj
ET
